# Google Reviews (see src/lib/googleReviews.ts)
#
# Fetched at BUILD TIME (astro build), not in the browser — this key never
# reaches the client. Needs the legacy "Places API" enabled in Google Cloud
# Console for whichever project owns the key.
#
# In production this is set as a GitHub Actions repo secret
# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY), read
# by .github/workflows/deploy.yml. For local `npm run build`, copy this file
# to `.env` and fill in a real key.
#
# Without this set, the build still succeeds — the reviews section falls
# back to a plain "Read them on Google" link instead of showing fake data.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
